Each activity item should include:

- Event type.
- Ward or department.
- Event time.
- Status.
- Responsible staff member, where appropriate.
- Action required.
- Link to the relevant record, subject to permissions.

Provide filters for all wards, individual wards, departments, event types, priority, and time range.

Updates should appear automatically through real-time subscriptions or an equivalent event-driven mechanism.

If a real-time connection is lost, display a connection warning and attempt to reconnect.

Never display a disconnected ward as fully up to date.

