- Do not bypass security rules to make a demonstration work.
- Do not use placeholder buttons for features described as implemented.
- Include database migrations, deployment instructions, and automated tests.
- Document any integrations that require additional credentials or paid services.

The final product should function as a centralized digital command center for Juaboso Government Hospital, enabling management to monitor bed capacity, identify pressure points, coordinate wards, reduce avoidable delays, and make informed operational decisions using accurate and timely information.